WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.084
They come to Fathom Fall chasing a fortune.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.174
Lost vaults. Forgotten tombs.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.690
Riches buried deep below.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.783
But those who’ve ventured below… keep their distance.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.703
They know what waits.
